<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>{{ date }} 데일리 마켓 브리핑</title>
<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: "KoPubDotum";
    font-weight: 700;
    src: url(data:font/woff2;base64,{{ font_bold }}) format("woff2");
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "KoPubDotum";
    font-weight: 500;
    src: url(data:font/woff2;base64,{{ font_medium }}) format("woff2");
  }

  @page { size: A4; margin: 14mm 14mm; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  :root {
    --hy-deep: #2D2864;      /* 한양증권 CI 워드마크 색 */
    --hy-mid: #754BE4;       /* 한양증권 CI 그라데이션 중간색 */
    --hy-light: #AB7CFB;     /* 한양증권 CI 그라데이션 밝은색 */
    --hy-tint: #F5F3FA;      /* 옅은 배경 */
    --hy-tint-line: #E2DBF2;
    --ink: #1B1626;
    --ink-soft: #58536A;
    --paper: #ffffff;
    --up: #D6273C;
    --down: #1D4ED8;
    --heat-up-3: #C81E2C; --heat-up-3-fg: #fff;
    --heat-up-2: #E2495A; --heat-up-2-fg: #fff;
    --heat-up-1: #F4B7BE; --heat-up-1-fg: #6b1420;
    --heat-flat: #E9E6EF; --heat-flat-fg: var(--ink-soft);
    --heat-down-1: #B7C9F6; --heat-down-1-fg: #16306e;
    --heat-down-2: #5C87E8; --heat-down-2-fg: #fff;
    --heat-down-3: #1D4ED8; --heat-down-3-fg: #fff;
  }

  body {
    font-family: "KoPubDotum", "Malgun Gothic", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 0 24px 0;
    line-height: 1.55;
    font-size: 14.5px;
  }
  b, strong { font-weight: 700; }

  .masthead {
    background: var(--hy-tint);
    padding: 12px 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .masthead img { height: 24px; display: block; }

  .page { padding: 18px 24px 0 24px; }

  .doc-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 230px; column-gap: 22px; }
  .date-line { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .date-line .today-tag { color: var(--hy-mid); font-weight: 700; }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 25px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
  .headline { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--hy-deep); margin-bottom: 2px; }

  hr.full-rule { border: none; border-top: 2px solid var(--hy-deep); margin: 12px 0 16px 0; }

  .body-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 230px; column-gap: 22px; align-items: start; }

  .main-col h2 {
    font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700;
    margin: 18px 0 8px 0; padding-left: 9px; border-left: 3px solid var(--hy-mid);
  }
  .main-col section:first-child h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  .main-col p { margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.7; }

  .heatmap { position: relative; height: 260px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .heat-box {
    position: absolute;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    padding: 2px 4px; text-align: center; overflow: hidden;
    outline: 1px solid var(--paper);
  }
  .heat-box .hname { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; max-width: 100%; }
  .heat-box .hpct { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .heat-up-3 { background: var(--heat-up-3); color: var(--heat-up-3-fg); }
  .heat-up-2 { background: var(--heat-up-2); color: var(--heat-up-2-fg); }
  .heat-up-1 { background: var(--heat-up-1); color: var(--heat-up-1-fg); }
  .heat-flat { background: var(--heat-flat); color: var(--heat-flat-fg); }
  .heat-down-1 { background: var(--heat-down-1); color: var(--heat-down-1-fg); }
  .heat-down-2 { background: var(--heat-down-2); color: var(--heat-down-2-fg); }
  .heat-down-3 { background: var(--heat-down-3); color: var(--heat-down-3-fg); }
  .heatmap-caption { font-size: 9.5px; color: #a29cb3; margin: -4px 0 8px 0; text-align: right; }

  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 13px; }
  table.ruled { border-top: 1.5px solid var(--hy-deep); border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--hy-deep); }
  table.ruled th { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hy-deep); }
  th, td { padding: 7px 9px; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  th { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
  td:first-child, th:first-child { text-align: left; }
  .up { color: var(--up); font-weight: 700; }
  .down { color: var(--down); font-weight: 700; }

  .side-col { border-left: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); padding-left: 20px; }
  .side-box { border: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .side-box-row {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline;
    padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 12.5px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line);
  }
  .side-box-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .side-box-row span { color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .side-box-row b { font-size: 12.5px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  .byline { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .byline .label { font-weight: 700; color: var(--hy-deep); font-size: 12.5px; }

  .side-list-title { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .cp-row {
    display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 2px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line);
  }
  .cp-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .cp-date { flex: none; width: 62px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--hy-mid); }
  .cp-event { font-size: 12.5px; }
  .cp-nearest { background: var(--hy-tint); border-left: 3px solid var(--hy-deep); padding-left: 7px; margin-left: -10px; padding-right: 2px; }
  .cp-nearest .cp-date { color: var(--hy-deep); }

  .footer {
    margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .footer img { height: 15px; opacity: 0.8; }
  .footer .disclaimer { font-size: 9.5px; color: #a29cb3; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="masthead">
  <img src="{{ logo_compact }}" alt="한양증권">
  <img src="{{ logo_compact }}" alt="한양증권">
</div>

<div class="page">

  <div class="doc-row">
    <div>
      <div class="date-line">{{ date }} ({{ weekday }}) 장마감 · <span class="today-tag">당일 발행</span></div>
      <h1>데일리 마켓 브리핑</h1>
      <div class="headline">{{ headline }}</div>
    </div>
    <div></div>
  </div>

  <hr class="full-rule">

  <div class="body-grid">
    <div class="main-col">

      <section>
        <h2>오늘의 마켓 요약</h2>
        <p>{{ market_summary_prose }}</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>업종 동향</h2>
        <div class="heatmap">
          {% for s in sectors -%}
          <div class="heat-box {{ s.heat_class }}" style="left:{{ s.x_pct }}%; top:{{ s.y_pct }}%; width:{{ s.w_pct }}%; height:{{ s.h_pct }}%;">
            <div class="hname">{{ s.name }}</div>
            <div class="hpct">{{ s.change_pct }}%</div>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="heatmap-caption">박스 크기 = 시가총액·거래대금 비중</div>
        <p>{{ sector_prose }}</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>오늘의 이슈 종목</h2>
        <div class="table-wrap"><table class="ruled">
          <tr><th>종목명(코드)</th><th>등락률</th><th style="text-align:left">이슈 및 이유</th></tr>
          {% for s in issue_stocks -%}
          <tr><td>{{ s.name }}({{ s.ticker }})</td><td class="{{ s.trend_class }}">{{ s.trend_symbol }} {{ s.change_pct }}%</td><td style="text-align:left">{{ s.reason }}</td></tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </table></div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>참고사항</h2>
        <p>{{ notes }}</p>
      </section>

    </div>

    <div class="side-col">
      <div class="side-box">
        <div class="side-box-row"><span>KOSPI</span><b class="{{ kospi.trend_class }}">{{ kospi.close }} {{ kospi.trend_symbol }}{{ kospi.change_pct }}%</b></div>
        <div class="side-box-row"><span>KOSDAQ</span><b class="{{ kosdaq.trend_class }}">{{ kosdaq.close }} {{ kosdaq.trend_symbol }}{{ kosdaq.change_pct }}%</b></div>
        <div class="side-box-row"><span>USD/KRW</span><b>{{ fx.rate }} ({{ fx.change }})</b></div>
        <div class="side-box-row"><span>미국 다우</span><b>{{ us.dow }}</b></div>
        <div class="side-box-row"><span>미국 S&amp;P500</span><b>{{ us.sp500 }}</b></div>
        <div class="side-box-row"><span>미국 나스닥</span><b>{{ us.nasdaq }}</b></div>
      </div>

      <div class="byline">
        <div class="label">한양증권 {{ branch_name }}</div>
        <div>{{ author }} {{ department }}</div>
        <div>문의: {{ contact }}</div>
        <div>발행: {{ generated_at }} (당일)</div>
      </div>

      <div class="side-list">
        <div class="side-list-title">단기 체크포인트 — 뭘, 언제</div>
        {% for cp in checkpoints -%}
        <div class="cp-row {{ 'cp-nearest' if cp.nearest else '' }}">
          <div class="cp-date">{{ cp.date }}</div>
          <div class="cp-event">{{ cp.event }}</div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <img src="{{ logo_compact }}" alt="한양증권">
    <div class="disclaimer">본 자료는 정보 제공 목적으로 작성되었으며 투자 권유가 아닙니다.</div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
